{"id": 41, "name": "Gatotkaca", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_b7a1b7f856deca1644516417db30acb6.png", "cls": ["Tank", "Fighter"], "specialty": ["Crowd Control", "Burst"], "difficulty": "10", "stats": ["90", "30", "90", "10"], "lanes": ["Roam", "Exp Lane"], "story": "Warrior from the Arcadhem universe.", "skills": [{"name": "Steel Bones", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2bcf1c5dea0b73298389955379bdc6b4.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}, {"tagid": 51, "tagname": "Heal", "tagrgb": "89,168,111"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Gatotkaca gains Physical Defense equal to 2% of his lost HP (up to 200). For every 300 damage he takes (calculated before damage reduction), he gains 5 Rage (up to 100).\n\nUpon reaching over 25 Rage, Gatotkaca's next Basic Attack becomes enhanced, consuming all Rage to deal extra <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and recover HP. The extra damage scales with his Rage, level, and Magic Power."}, {"name": "Blast Iron Fist", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_14b9b342dddb7cc721b7e93ba38a33ff.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 8", "desc": "Gatotkaca slams the ground, creating a shattered zone in the target direction while dealing 200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies within. Enemies in the shattered zone will take 100<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+20% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> per second and be slowed by 30%."}, {"name": "Unbreakable", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_6c888f8a9fb4daac350896e27d7f49eb.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "